"Woah woah woah, cool your jets.  I can't let this spread about me, so name "
"your price and keep quiet, and I might give you a discount."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
