#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Barry!  Oh my god, you found him!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
msgid "Barry!  You're okay!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
msgid "Oh god, oh thank god.  Let's get Barry out of here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
msgid "What's up?  Change of plans?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
msgid "Everything OK?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
msgid "Not really a good time for a chat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
msgid "I can't believe this is happening."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
msgid "We've got him, let's get out of here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
msgid "Right.  Let's do this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*eyes you up and down with a nervous smile.  \"I almost didn't expect you to "
"show up.\"  He hesitates, letting out a soft laugh.  \"That sounds bad.  I "
"just mean, I can't really believe we're doing this.  Thank you… for doing "
"this.  You ready to get Uncle Barry?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*eyes you up and down with a nervous smile.  \"I almost didn't expect you to "
"show up.\"  He hesitates, letting out a soft laugh.  \"That sounds bad.  I "
"just mean, I can't really believe we're doing this.  Thank you… for doing "
"this.  You ready to get Uncle Barry?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*eyes you up and down with a nervous smile.  \"I almost didn't expect you to "
"show up.\"  He hesitates, letting out a soft laugh.  \"That sounds bad.  I "
"just mean, I can't really believe we're doing this.  Thank you… for doing "
"this.  You ready to get Uncle Barry?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
msgid "You got it, let's go!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/Isherwood_Rescue_NPC_Duplicates.json
msgid "Not yet, just give me a minute."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*crouches on the bottom of his cell, shivering, then looks up as you "
"approach.  He blinks a few times, then stands up.  He's totally nude, and his"
" tanned body is covered in tiny, precise-looking scars of varying ages.  \"I "
"can't believe my eyes.  Please get me outta here…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Are you Barry Isherwood?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'll get you out of here, just stay calm.  <lets_go>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'm Luke Skywalker, I'm here to rescue you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "You just hold tight here for a second."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"What?\"  The naked, traumatized man stares at you blankly, as though he'd "
"never seen Star Wars, which is clearly ridiculous.  \"Rescue me?  Yes, oh "
"please yes!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Okay then, your family's outside.  Let me go get them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hang on.  I've got questions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Just hold on a little longer, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*gulps.  \"I sure as hell am.  Did my family send you?  Please, we gotta go."
"  There are more of those things.  They're everywhere.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Yeah, they did, I'll go get them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Yeah, Chris did, we're taking you home."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*switches, abruptly, to pure white-hot rage.  \"DOES THIS LOOK LIKE A TIME "
"FOR FUCKING QUESTIONS?\"  He stops, shaking, and returns to how he was "
"before.  \"I'm sorry.  I'm so sorry.  Oh god, I'm sorry.  I need to get out "
"of here.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Okay, me too, let's go."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "All right, we're leaving, but you better not test me again."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Okay, me too.  I'll go get your family."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"All right, we're leaving, but you better not test me again.  I'll be back "
"with your family."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Pff.  If you're gonna treat me like that, you can stay here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Let's get back to the farm, as fast as possible."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "What farm?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"That shouldn't take long, your family's outside waiting.  I'll be back with "
"them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"That shouldn't take long, I brought some of your family with me.  Let's get "
"you home."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"\"Oh, so my family didn't send you then.\"  Barry looks downtrodden for a "
"brief moment.  \"Look, we just need to get out of here first, I'll tell you "
"about it later.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Okay, sounds good to me.  <lets_go>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sorry about the Luke Skywalker joke."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "What farm were you going to tell me about earlier?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I've thought about it some more, and I'd like to have the directions to your "
"farm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Maybe let's talk about you a little bit.  What's your role in this family?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Come on, let's get out of here while we still can.  I don't want to spend any"
" longer around here then we need too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "*lights up as you approach, but also looks wary.  \""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, Jedi.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hey, <name_g>.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I can't wait to get back home and see everyone.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "*nods.  \"Of course, what'd you want to ask?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*laughs.  \"It was terrible timing, but I have to admit, you don't see many "
"situations that perfect for that reference.  Sorry I didn't get it at the "
"time.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It's still a bit fresh, but okay.  Yeah.  Let me sit down first.\"  Barry "
"takes a seat, his hands shaking even at the prospect of discussing the tower "
"and the things he saw.  \"What should we talk about?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "What happened to you in there?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "On second thought, I think you should recover more."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*shivers, though the room is warm, and moves his mouth wordlessly for a few "
"seconds.  \"It's hard to remember details.  The air in that place messes with"
" your brain, makes it all feel like some kind of dream.  Makes it so you "
"can't fight back.  Not that I could have anyway.\"  He stares into space for "
"a moment, then swallows hard.  \"They cut into me, over and over.  I don't "
"think they took anything out.  They just opened me up, poked around.  I was "
"awake for all of it, as awake as for anything else.  Sometimes I felt pain, "
"other times they did something to me so I could feel it but it didn't hurt.  "
"There were big, pale ones that did the cutting.\"  His voice gets "
"increasingly detached as he speaks, and his shaking grows worse.  You're not "
"sure it would be wise for him to go further."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "[Let him continue.]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "That's enough for now, Barry."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*shudders, looking like he might vomit.  \"What did they want?  Why me?  "
"Every time, they'd put me back together again, seal it up and make it look "
"almost like nothing happened.\"  He yanks up his shirt to show the scars.  "
"\"But I know what happened, it was REAL, goddammit!\"  He drops the shirt, "
"bends forward, and dry heaves for a few seconds.  Wordless, he hides his face"
" in his hands, and stops responding."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah.  Yeah.\"  He takes a long, shaky breath.  \"Yeah, you're right.  This "
"isn't going anywhere good.  Claire's been talking about making some dandelion"
" wine,\" he says with a hollow smile.  \"Maybe I'll go see if she needs help."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"How about we change the subject instead?  What's your role in this family?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Good idea."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"&He wipes his hand across his face, tension leaving him as he runs his "
"fingers through his hair.  \"Yeah, okay.  To be honest, years ago I was the "
"black sheep.  Moved off the family farm, lived out in Bunyan.  Went to "
"college, thought I'd get a job in computers.\"  He shuffles in his chair, "
"smiling half-heartedly.  \"I did sysadmin stuff for a while, back when the "
"internet was fairly new.  Then my dad died.  Carlos and Jesse had just gotten"
" married, and at the time it looked like they might be getting some land of "
"their own, and Eddie was out finding himself.  My dad and I had never got "
"along, but Jack…\" he stops.  \"Sorry, I don't think you were looking for my "
"life story.  What did you ask, again?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "No, go on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "You're right.  I was asking something different."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "It's okay, I'm going to head out."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Fair enough, you asked for it.\"  He stretches his arms out.  \"Jack and I "
"stayed close, even after my old man and I fell out, so when it looked like he"
" was going to be saddled with the entire farm to run, I took a good long look"
" at my life and realized I hated it.  It was never the farm I was trying to "
"get away from, you know?  I packed up my things, quit my job, and came out to"
" help Jack.  Never looked back.\"  He chuckles.  \"Damn hard finding a "
"partner for a guy like me out here though.  I was in a long-term relationship"
" when I left, but that fell apart.  I haven't been too lonely though, I've "
"got my people."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"[PER 9] Was your choice in partners part of the problem with your father?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Thanks for taking the time to talk to me.  I had some other questions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/refugee_caravans.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
msgid "Thanks for the story.  <end_talking_leave>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"&His eyebrows shoot up, briefly surprised, then he smiles.  \"You nailed it "
"in one.  Yeah, we're talking about a rural farmer in the nineties, here.  My "
"dad never understood me, even before he knew, and he did find out, although I"
" tried to keep the closet door closed.  Jack, though, he always saw me for "
"me.  Never let it change our relationship.  That's real love, and that's what"
" made me come back when he needed me.  Meanwhile, the man I thought I'd "
"marry, back in Bunyan, he couldn't be assed even to come out and see the "
"family farm, let alone think about moving here.  He was dead weight, and I've"
" never doubted that decision.\"  He shrugs.  \"There's folks like me wherever"
" you go, I've had a few relationships since then.  Just nothing that stuck, "
"and I'm okay with that.  If nothing else, it proved what I already knew: "
"aside from my old man, none of my family treated me or them any different for"
" it.  They're good people.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah, now I remember.  That farm I was talking about is where I live, "
"almost the whole Isherwood family lives there, including me.  I just wanted "
"to get back home as fast as possible so I can see everyone again, and so "
"everyone knows that I'm okay."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Can you give me some directions to it?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "That's pretty cool.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Sure, can I please see your map?\"  Barry takes your map, orients himself, "
"and points out a route to the farm.  \"Once we've done that, I'll head on "
"myself so everyone won't be surprised by you coming.  Sound good?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Sounds good to me, let's hit the road."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "I'd like to think about it some more."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "Return Barry to Isherwood's farm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*is an older middle-aged man, well-muscled and darkly tanned, with worried "
"lines around the corners of his eyes and mouth.  He looks up as you get close"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
", and then puts his hand on the butt of the rifle slung across  his back.  "
"\"I see that badge, I think you need to keep on walking, straight off this "
"property.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ", then smiles distantly.  \"Hello Sir, what brings you here?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ", then smiles distantly.  \"Hello Ma'am, what brings you here?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "…[Leave.]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"* glares at you, his hand moving again to his gun.  \"I see that badge, I "
"think you need to keep on walking, straight off this property.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*rolls his eyes.  \"I'm not an idiot.  You think if you don't wear your "
"badge, I won't know who you're working for?  Get out of here.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Look, I took it off to show I'm not here as a marshal.  I'm just here as a "
"traveler, someone who can maybe help you out.  I know you've got problems "
"bigger than you can handle right now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
msgid "*looks up warily as you approach"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
", looking at your marshal badge immediately.  \"You said you'd keep that "
"goddamn piece of tin out of my sight.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
", looking at your marshal badge immediately.  \"You said you'd keep that "
"goddamn piece of tin out of my sight.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
", looking at your marshal badge immediately.  \"You said you'd keep that "
"goddamn piece of tin out of my sight.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ".  \"Yeah?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Oh, right… [Leave.]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*struggles to think of a reply for a moment, then drops his hand from his "
"gun.  \"We've got that under control, but you're not wrong.  An extra pair of"
" hands wouldn't hurt, just now.  Just keep that damn badge out of my sight.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "Fine.  Thanks.  Tell me more about what happened to Barry."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"It was pink and really fast, it had lots of limbs, definitely not human.\"  "
"Carlos rubs the back of his hand idly, staring into space.  \"It easily kept "
"up with us when we tried to escape, horrifying stuff.  Barry just dropped to "
"the ground, and the thing swept him away."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*frowns at you.  \"Of course not.  We tracked it for a while, but lost the "
"trail.  Right now we don't have the resources to try to rescue him.  My son, "
"Chris, has been trying to pick up the trail again and figure out a rescue "
"plan.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid "I could help.  Where did Chris go?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*shakes his head.  \"Leave Chris be, he knows what he's doing.  Give him some"
" time.  Calling more attention to him could get both of you killed.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"The big item I need is an anvil, once I have that I can get a lot of repairs "
"done.\"  He smiles briefly.  \"Can't exactly head to town to get it done "
"anymore, but I learned a bit of old world metalwork from my granddad."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*gestures around the workspace, which looks more set up.  \"I'm figuring "
"things out, getting it worked out.  It's been a while since I did this kind "
"of metalwork."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, it's coming along nice.\"  He slaps the surface of the anvil.  \"Thanks"
" for this, I'm still getting my skills back up, but it's going to be real "
"helpful."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Chris is hiking the perimeter of our land, planning some defense options.\"  "
"He looks you up and down.  \"Best just let him be."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Carlos_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*looks at you curiously.  \"Should be where you saw him last.  He's not "
"missing again, is he?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Hi, your dad asked me to come find you, said you've been looking for your "
"uncle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, what have you been up to lately."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Can I hear your ideas about the world ending, now that we saved Barry?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Have you had any ideas for what your family could do?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Do you think we're ready to try this again?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I've got some SWAT gear that should work for the assault."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I've got enough SWAT gear to set everyone up for the assault."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"[LIE] I tried to get the SWAT gear, but it looks like someone looted it "
"before I could get there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I've got enough bags to set up a defensive wall."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*is a young man, perhaps in his early twenties or late teens.  He eyes you up"
" and down.  \""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I see that badge.  You need to leave our land, my relatives have no fondness "
"for Marshals.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I see you took the badge off.  Fine, then, but you'd better not let anyone "
"here know you've got ties to the Marshals.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I see you took the badge off.  Fine, then, but you'd better not let anyone "
"here know you've got ties to the Marshals.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"I see you took the badge off.  Fine, then, but you'd better not let anyone "
"here know you've got ties to the Marshals.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Hi, what's up?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I surveyed the land, and I am trying to track the changes.  I fixed up this "
"cabin for some peace and quiet… you can settle here if you want"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Do you think, monsters that kidnaped Barry are responsible for end of the "
"world?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "I doubt that, other monsters and zombies attacked them way too often"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I might be able to help you get Barry back, but we've got to plan this out."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"&Chris looks you up and down, and nods.  \"I'm definitely not going to say no"
" to a willing body, and you look like you know what's up.\"  He sighs.  \"To "
"be honest with you, I've been a bit stuck.  I can't tackle that thing alone, "
"and I'm not willing to bring my dad or Uncle Eddie in either.  Dad's got a "
"bum knee - don't tell him I said that - and Eddie's not that great a shot.  "
"Luke's still too young for something like this… you get the idea.\"  He leans"
" forward, self-consciously running his hand through his hair.  \"I think if "
"we work together maybe we'd stand a chance.  I don't have a great plan "
"though.  That tower doesn't look like something a person could just storm up "
"to full-frontal style.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Actually, I was just planning to go in by myself.  I've handled worse."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"I've got my own team here, we'll take this.  You stay back here, keep the "
"family safe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I think we should work together on this.  Do you mind if I take the "
"lead?  I've probably got more experience."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid ""
"*looks at you with obvious doubt.  \"You sure you know what you're getting "
"into?  I can't stop you if you plan on going in solo, but it seems like a "
"terrible idea.  Those things mean business.  I won't be able to go in and "
"help you if you get trapped too.  It's probably better we pair up.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Chris_Isherwood.json
msgid "Trust me.  See you in a bit."
msgstr ""
